---
// Hero: character dossier. Cryo-element ambiance via CSS gradients (no fake
// screenshot, no copyrighted official splash art). Replace the marked slot with a
// licensed visual later.
const facts = [
  { k: "Element", v: "Cryo" },
  { k: "Weapon", v: "Polearm" },
  { k: "Rarity", v: "5-Star" },
  { k: "Constellation", v: "Cuniculus" },
  { k: "Title", v: "Vice Captain, Favonius Fifth Company" },
  { k: "Region", v: "Mondstadt" },
  { k: "Affiliation", v: "Knights of Favonius" },
  { k: "Release", v: "6.6, May 20, 2026" },
  { k: "Birthday", v: "April 3" },
  { k: "Story Quest", v: "Cuniculus Chapter (狡兔之章)" },
];
const voiceActors = "EN Nick Wolfhard · CN Lin Jingnan · JP Amasaki Kohei";
const role = "On-field Main DPS";
const tierList = "Tier: S (Melt comp) · A (Freeze/Mono Cryo)";
const strengths = [
  { t: "Front-loaded burst window", d: "All damage lands in a short Masterstroke window, ideal for Abyss chamber timers." },
  { t: "Elite Melt synergy", d: "Four rapid Hexerei chain hits consume Pyro aura efficiently, the best Melt trigger cadence among polearm DPS." },
  { t: "Fully functional at C0", d: "Core kit is complete at base constellation; constellations are power, not necessity." },
  { t: "F2P weapon-friendly", d: "The 3-star White Tassel is genuinely competitive, closing most of the gap to his signature weapon." },
  { t: "Self-contained resources", d: "Will to Win generates without field time pressure, letting the rest of the team set up first." },
];
const weaknesses = [
  { t: "Short, interruptible window", d: "Miss Masterstroke timing or get staggered mid-chain and you lose a large share of the rotation." },
  { t: "Melt-reliant ceiling", d: "Without a Pyro applier, damage drops roughly 50% on every hit; the ceiling requires Durin or Xiangling." },
  { t: "Energy-hungry rotation", d: "The 80-cost Burst needs 120-130% ER to guarantee each cycle, eating a stat slot." },
  { t: "Melee positioning", d: "Hexerei chains have a forward arc and can whiff on mobile or small enemies without grouping." },
  { t: "Roster-gated value", d: "As a sidegrade to Ganyu/Ayaka, his perceived value drops sharply if you already own a Cryo DPS." },
];
---

<section id="top" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-800/70">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute -right-32 -top-32 h-[28rem] w-[28rem] rounded-full opacity-25 blur-3xl"
      style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #3aa7c4 0%, transparent 70%)"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute -left-40 bottom-0 h-[24rem] w-[24rem] rounded-full opacity-10 blur-3xl"
      style="background: radial-gradient(circle, #5cc4d9 0%, transparent 70%)"
    ></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-4 pb-12 pt-14 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] md:items-center md:pb-14 md:pt-16">
    <div>
      <h1
        class="mt-4 text-5xl font-extrabold leading-none tracking-tighter text-slate-50 sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
      >
        Lohen{" "}
        <span class="mt-4 block text-xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-frost-400 sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl">
          Genshin Impact Character Guide
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-slate-200">
        The Aggressive Vanguard
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[36rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Lohen is a 5-star Cryo polearm user who fights on the front line with a
        dual-resource kit: he builds Joy and Will to Win, then enters the Masterstroke
        state to unleash Hexerei chained attacks that deal substantial Cryo damage.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-frost-700/40 bg-frost-950/30 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200">
        <span class="font-semibold text-frost-400">Pull verdict:</span>
        Worth pulling if you need a front-line Cryo DPS, especially in Melt teams with Durin and Nicole.
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="font-semibold text-frost-400">S-Tier</span>
        in the 6.6 Melt comp, A-Tier in Freeze/Mono Cryo
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="#mechanics"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-frost-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition-colors hover:bg-frost-400"
        >
          Mechanics Explained
        </a>
        <a
          href="#pull"
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-200 transition-colors hover:border-frost-500 hover:text-frost-400"
        >
          Should you pull?
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[34rem] text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        One page. Every answer. No ten tabs, no login wall, no top-up ads.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
      <img
        src="/hero-visual.webp"
        alt="Stylized artwork of Lohen, a young knight with a polearm surrounded by cyan Cryo frost on a deep navy background"
        width="768"
        height="1152"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
        class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-slate-800"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-6 sm:px-6">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-5 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5">
        {facts.map((f) => (
          <div>
            <dt class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
              {f.k}
            </dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">{f.v}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 border-t border-slate-800/70 pt-5">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
          Voice Actors
        </span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">{voiceActors}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/70 pt-4">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
          Role & Tier
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">{role}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-frost-400">{tierList}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/70 pt-4">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
          Max Stats (Lv. 90)
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-5 gap-3 text-center">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">HP</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">13,108</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">ATK</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">352</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">DEF</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">799</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">CRIT Rate</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">5.0%</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">CRIT DMG</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">50.0%</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-800/70 pt-4">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
          Stats Per Ascension Phase
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full min-w-[480px] border-collapse text-xs">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-slate-800 text-left">
                <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-medium text-slate-500">Lv.</th>
                <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-medium text-slate-500">HP</th>
                <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-medium text-slate-500">ATK</th>
                <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-medium text-slate-500">DEF</th>
                <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-medium text-slate-500">Ascension Bonus</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-800/60">
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">1</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">1,003</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">27</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">61</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">—</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">20</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">2,602</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">70</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">159</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">—</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">40</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">4,871</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">131</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">297</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +8%</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">50</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">6,158</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">166</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">375</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +8%</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">60</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">7,445</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">200</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">454</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +16%</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">70</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">8,732</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">235</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">532</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +16%</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">80</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">10,019</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">269</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">611</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +24%</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">90</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">13,108</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">352</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-300">799</td><td class="py-1.5 pr-3 text-slate-400">CRIT Rate +24%</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Ascension bonus: CRIT Rate. At max ascension, Lohen gains 24% CRIT Rate from his stat growth, which stacks with the Cold Front passive (8% during Masterstroke) for a built-in 32% CRIT Rate.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-14 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid gap-6 pb-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-900/40 bg-emerald-950/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-emerald-400">
          Strengths
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
          {strengths.map((s) => (
            <div class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">{s.t}</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{s.d}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-rose-900/40 bg-rose-950/20 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-rose-400">
          Weaknesses
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
          {weaknesses.map((w) => (
            <div class="flex gap-3">
              <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-rose-400" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">{w.t}</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">{w.d}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 border-t border-slate-800/70 pt-6 sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-frost-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Independent fan guide
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-frost-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        No paywalls or ads
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-frost-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Official data + community tests
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-frost-500" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Updated every version
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-50 sm:text-2xl">
        Who Is Lohen? Lore & Background
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        Lohen is the Vice Captain of the Knights of Favonius Fifth Company, a remote
        scouting unit based far from Mondstadt's city walls. Despite commanding a unit of
        ranged marksmen, he carries a polearm and fights from the front — a contradiction
        that defines both his personality and his kit. His aggressive, win-at-all-costs
        combat style ("I'll close the distance myself" is a recurring line) is why his
        kit is built around the dual resources <strong class="text-slate-200">Joy</strong> and
        <strong class="text-slate-200">Will to Win</strong>: he literally "wills himself to win"
        as the fight goes on, then spends that will as raw offense.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        His story quest, the Cuniculus Chapter, follows his return to Mondstadt during the
        6.6 "Luna VII" events. It explores why he left the city, his rivalry-turned-
        alliance with the alchemist Rhinedottir's old associates, and how he learned to
        trust teammates after years of charging in alone. Thematically, the quest mirrors
        his gameplay: Lohen learns that even a front-line fighter needs the team behind
        him — which is why his best team is the 6.6 trio of <strong class="text-slate-200">Lohen +
        Durin + Nicole</strong>, not a solo carry.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Signature Weapon</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">Disaster and Remorse (灾与悔)</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">5-star polearm, his best-in-slot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Character Theme</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">"The Aggressive Vanguard"</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Ranged unit, melee fighter — the core character hook.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Key Story Links</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100">Durin · Nicole · Rhinedottir</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">6.6 storyline and his signature team.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
